{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":94689,\"title\":\"The Stoneman Murders\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Find out if the Stoneman of 90's Kolkata still out in the streets? It's a thriller about the stone-man murders taking place in late 80s around Calcutta. hoichoi brings the story from a different point of view, showcasing why someone would resort to mass killing.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7UvGVG26M8O5rvu0wnjw3GEwkQe.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1IQCapX2vEdLWYsEaLeFvqemT8.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":9,\"createdBy\":[\"Ejaz Saiyed\"],\"networks\":[\"hoichoi\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2436179,\"name\":\"Ejaz Saiyed\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1796863,\"name\":\"Rupankar Bagchi\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bASPRw2hNn1MtgbXK9u8y3Ll5rD.jpg\"},{\"id\":1144344,\"name\":\"Swastika Mukherjee\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjEdXwco3KjWU7zFDhJgMJYmerh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1280377,\"name\":\"Rajatabha Dutta\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ukhcXEule4DROSsd4MtXaVoQnt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1662480,\"name\":\"Arijit Dutta\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jSgVIMuR1emLGJNdKJ9JdmZMTH7.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"dNj4SxVqdag\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"u7ou9BBNVKI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"i40C1lX19Ac\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"An old, mysterious diary - with descriptions of murders! Is the “Stoneman” murderer of the 90’s Kolkata back? Watch The Stoneman Murders on hoichoi.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gWJryowYMuzj5s8xflRiPi148Po.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Saint and Sins\",\"overview\":\"Sneha, an aspiring writer, runs into Baba Jibanananda on a train to Haridwar. Who is he and what are his intentions?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1rV67UTP4vzX23QqaQJ9lVOGHGv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Camouflage\",\"overview\":\"While Sneha and Saina take a tour around Haridwar, they are followed by a sadhu. Is he one of Baba Jibanananda's men?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dWQGOzrGZonrl7zXEnYoatLbVj5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Before the Murder\",\"overview\":\"Sneha reads the diary she received and tries to solve the mystery behind the infamous murderer called the \\\"Stoneman\\\". Will she find the truth?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xIYMqfXNws9zpFiBWsedhAODABJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Face to Face\",\"overview\":\"Sneha looks around for evidence and figures out a possible suspect. Will she go to the police?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1F34U6nizYB1ji0lxuafjQeLcfx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Do It Now\",\"overview\":\"Sneha meets the investigators of the case. Will they believe in the authenticity of the diary after reading it?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kB3gFAWF88pMzMPjQmn4PAiRk1X.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Friend in Disguise\",\"overview\":\"The Stoneman tries to find a way to tackle Haran, while the police attempt to figure out his motive. Will they uncover his reason for murder?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8OsXYUb4UianUV1PrfYhyquMpJu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Hide and Seek\",\"overview\":\"The Stoneman is chased by a gang, as Sneha and Saina are interrogated. Will, the police make a move?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xHkCSyeLdAB6UmkcOZTRRJOqqeU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Revenge\",\"overview\":\"While Sneha discusses with Saina about the real identity of the Stoneman, the police locate his address. Will they find him?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qhDsFeJXOMfK8NxGBER6KUCzVFa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"In Search of a Mystery\",\"overview\":\"Stoneman is attacked by a gang, as Sneha discloses her findings to her mother. Will the police catch the Stoneman red-handed?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sCLuzGgv8cGxPNlsxU6wusKsReB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-20\",\"runtime\":161}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-09-13\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}